{"seq":2,"slug":"scheduled-delivery-date-window","title":"预约送达日期、时段与截单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-order-payforward-delivery/gift-payment-scheduled/scheduled-delivery-date-window","wordCount":2490,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"预约送达日期-时段与截单\">预约送达日期、时段与截单</h1><p>&quot;12 月 24 日上午送到她手上&quot;是一句业务承诺，背后却是一串硬约束的连锁：仓库在截单时间前必须收到订单、承运商在当天必须有运力、收件人所在的小区在那个时段必须真的能被投递。礼品订单把这串约束从&quot;可选功能&quot;变成&quot;核心体验&quot;——因为礼物的价值高度依赖<strong>到达时刻的语义</strong>。提前一天到只是提前，晚一天到可能就完全失去了意义。</p>\n<p>本文讲预约送达的工程机制：<strong>时段的产品形态与产能模型、截单时间的计算、以及预约承诺的合同边界</strong>。时段与地址时区的耦合见 <a href=\"../gift-order-model/recipient-address-collect-claim\">收件人地址收集与领取确认</a>，节日日历如何反过来压缩产能见 <a href=\"../gift-fulfillment-customs/holiday-calendar-fulfill-cutoff\">跨境节日日历与履约截单</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预约送达（attended home delivery）是一个成熟的运筹问题，不是简单的&quot;下拉框里选个时间&quot;。它的困难在于<strong>供给方要先承诺、后执行</strong>：时段必须在顾客下单那一刻就被确定下来，但那个时段是否真的可履约，取决于下单之后不断变化的需求分布与路由结果。学术上这被建模为一个收益管理问题——在顾客逐步到达的过程中，动态决定哪些时段可以开放、以什么价格开放，目标是最大化利润。近年研究把配送时段的定价明确建模为动态规划问题，并指出近似动态规划的方法在真实数据下的表现：梯度有界动态规划（gradient-bounded dynamic programming）在计算时间、利润与抗参数估计误差的稳健性上都优于对照算法（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2008.00780\">Lebedev, Margellos, Goulart, &quot;Approximate Dynamic Programming for Delivery Time Slot Pricing: a Sensitivity Analysis&quot;, arXiv:2008.00780</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二个概念是<strong>承诺的合同法边界</strong>。在美国，邮购/网售商品的发货时限有明确的规则底线：卖方须有合理依据相信能在广告时间发货，否则须&quot;在收到买方完整订单后三十（30）天内&quot;发货；若无法按时发货，须&quot;清楚显著地、无需买方要求地&quot;向买方提供&quot;同意延迟或取消订单并获及时退款&quot;的选项，且通知中必须&quot;给出确定的新的发货日期&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/435.2\">FTC Mail, Internet, or Telephone Order Merchandise Rule, 16 CFR § 435.2</a>）。这条规则的工程含义是：<strong>&quot;预约送达日&quot;在系统里必须区分&quot;可承诺&quot;与&quot;期望值&quot;</strong>，因为一旦对外表述为承诺，就触发了告知与退款的义务链。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单创建:选择送达日期] --&gt; B[查询该日期的可用时段]&#10;  B --&gt; C{产能是否充足?}&#10;  C --&gt;|充足| D[锁定时段&lt;br/&gt;占用一次产能配额]&#10;  C --&gt;|不足| E[仅提供日期不提供时段&lt;br/&gt;或提示替代日期]&#10;  D --&gt; F[进入截单等待]&#10;  F --&gt; G{到达截单时间前付款完成?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[释放给履约&lt;br/&gt;时段转为硬约束]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[释放该时段产能&lt;br/&gt;订单取消或转为无预约]&#10;  H --&gt; J[与装箱/路由系统对接]&#10;  J --&gt; K{实际路由可行?}&#10;  K --&gt;|否| L[降级:改约或退回时段费]&#10;  K --&gt;|是| M[按预约时段投递]\">graph TD\n  A[订单创建:选择送达日期] --&gt; B[查询该日期的可用时段]\n  B --&gt; C{产能是否充足?}\n  C --&gt;|充足| D[锁定时段&lt;br/&gt;占用一次产能配额]\n  C --&gt;|不足| E[仅提供日期不提供时段&lt;br/&gt;或提示替代日期]\n  D --&gt; F[进入截单等待]\n  F --&gt; G{到达截单时间前付款完成?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[释放给履约&lt;br/&gt;时段转为硬约束]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[释放该时段产能&lt;br/&gt;订单取消或转为无预约]\n  H --&gt; J[与装箱/路由系统对接]\n  J --&gt; K{实际路由可行?}\n  K --&gt;|否| L[降级:改约或退回时段费]\n  K --&gt;|是| M[按预约时段投递]</pre><h2 id=\"时段的产品形态与产能模型\">时段的产品形态与产能模型</h2><h3 id=\"五种常见的时段形态\">五种常见的时段形态</h3><p>时段不是只有一种。不同的形态对应完全不同的履约成本与系统复杂度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>消费者体验</th>\n<th>履约成本</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅日期（date only）</td>\n<td>某天送达</td>\n<td>低精度但足够</td>\n<td>最低，可自由路由</td>\n<td>标准快递、跨境直邮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半天（am/pm）</td>\n<td>上午或下午</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低，只需约束路由窗口</td>\n<td>大部分本地电商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两小时窗口</td>\n<td>09:00–11:00</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中，需要排线优化</td>\n<td>生鲜、大件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确时刻</td>\n<td>14:30 送达</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高，需实时调度</td>\n<td>鲜花、蛋糕、白手套</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指定日期 + 时间前</td>\n<td>12 月 24 日 12:00 前</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>节日礼物主场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是礼物场景最常用的形态：它给了收件人&quot;当天一定到&quot;的确定感，又不要求承运商承诺精确分钟。选择形态的关键不是&quot;越精确越好&quot;，而是<strong>精确度是否与业务承诺一致</strong>——承诺两小时窗口却做不到，比只承诺半天更伤害信任。</p>\n<h3 id=\"产能模型-时段是一种有限资源\">产能模型：时段是一种有限资源</h3><p>时段产能的本质是&quot;在那个时间窗内，这条线路还能塞下几个停靠点&quot;。它由三个量共同决定：车辆数、时间窗长度、以及每个停靠点的平均耗时（含行驶）。粗略的容量上界是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{slot} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{n_{vehicle} \\times T_{slot}}{t_{travel} + t_{service}} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{slot}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时段长度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{travel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该区域内平均行驶时间、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{service}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单个停靠的服务时间。这个上界必须<strong>按区域分别计算</strong>，因为不同小区的密度差异巨大：市中心高层住宅与郊区独栋的两个小时窗口，实际容纳的停靠数可能差三倍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE delivery_slot_capacity (&#10;  slot_id         BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  delivery_date   DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  window_start    TIME         NOT NULL,&#10;  window_end      TIME         NOT NULL,&#10;  region_code     VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,   -- 分拣/派送区域&#10;  capacity_total  INT          NOT NULL,   -- 该时段该区域可用容量&#10;  capacity_held   INT          NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, -- 被预约占用&#10;  capacity_safety INT          NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, -- 预留缓冲，不对外售卖&#10;  updated_at      TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_capacity CHECK (&#10;    capacity_held + capacity_safety &lt;= capacity_total)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ix_slot_open ON delivery_slot_capacity (delivery_date, region_code);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delivery_slot_capacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slot_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delivery_date   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_start    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_end      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  region_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分拣/派送区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  capacity_total  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该时段该区域可用容量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  capacity_held   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 被预约占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  capacity_safety </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 预留缓冲，不对外售卖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_capacity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    capacity_held </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity_safety </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity_total)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ix_slot_open</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delivery_slot_capacity (delivery_date, region_code);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>capacity_safety</code> 是关键的一列：它把&quot;预留给改约、VIP 与运营调整&quot;的容量从可售容量中永久扣除。缺少这一列的系统会在旺季把每个时段卖到 100%，然后当第一个顾客要求改约时无位可换，只能整体降级。<strong>永远不要对外售卖满额产能</strong>，预留比例通常按历史改约率加安全边际确定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容量扣减必须与支付状态联动\">容量扣减必须与支付状态联动</h3><p>时段被&quot;锁定&quot;不等于被&quot;占用&quot;。正确做法是：选时段时先做<strong>软占用</strong>（写入一条带过期时间的 hold），付款成功后再转为硬占用；hold 到期未支付则自动释放。这与库存预留是同一模式，区别在于这里的资源不是实物而是时间窗。若不做软占用，两个用户并发选择同一时段的最后一个位置时会双双成功，履约时才发现超卖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"截单时间-从承诺倒推\">截单时间：从承诺倒推</h2><h3 id=\"截单不是时间点-是一条依赖链\">截单不是时间点，是一条依赖链</h3><p>&quot;截单时间&quot;很容易被写成一个配置常量，实际上它是<strong>从送达日期往回倒推的一串约束中最紧的那个</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def compute_cutoff(target_date, region, carrier):&#10;    constraints = [&#10;        target_date - warehouse_pick_cutoff_delta,      # 仓库拣货截单&#10;        target_date - carrier_dispatch_cutoff_delta,    # 承运商取件截单&#10;        target_date - linehaul_cutoff_delta,            # 干线发车截单&#10;        target_date - customs_clearance_cutoff_delta,   # 跨境清关所需前置时间&#10;    ]&#10;    if is_holiday_eve(target_date):&#10;        constraints.append(target_date - peak_buffer_delta)&#10;    return min(constraints)   # 最紧的那个决定实际截单\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_cutoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target_date, region, carrier):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    constraints </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_pick_cutoff_delta,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仓库拣货截单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_dispatch_cutoff_delta,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 承运商取件截单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> linehaul_cutoff_delta,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 干线发车截单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customs_clearance_cutoff_delta,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 跨境清关所需前置时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_holiday_eve(target_date):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        constraints.append(target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak_buffer_delta)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(constraints)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最紧的那个决定实际截单</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>min</code> 而不是相加：这些约束是<strong>并行的前置期</strong>，不是串行的工序间隔（清关与干线可以部分并行）。最大的一处陷阱是跨境场景——清关的前置期波动很大且不可控，因此跨境预约送达的截单时间通常比本地提前好几天，且必须按目的国分别配置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"截单时间的时区归属\">截单时间的时区归属</h3><p>截单时间对谁而言？付款人在纽约、仓库在深圳、&quot;12 月 24 日送达&quot;发生在东京。截单必须绑定<strong>仓库所在时区</strong>（因为拣货动作在那里发生），而展示给用户时应转换成她自己的时区，并在文案中明确标注。这与 <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339.html\">RFC 3339</a> 的偏移语义一致：存储带偏移的时间点，展示时按查看者本地时区渲染。把截单存成裸的本地时间字符串，会在跨时区与夏令时切换时产生系统性偏差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节日前的非线性压缩\">节日前的非线性压缩</h3><p>节日前的产能不是线性下降，而是<strong>断崖式</strong>：承运商在节前最后几天会停止接收新件，仓库的拣货产能被同期的订单峰值吃满。因此节日预约的关键不是&quot;精确计算&quot;，而是<strong>提前设定不可预约的日期</strong>。这一部分与 <a href=\"../gift-fulfillment-customs/holiday-calendar-fulfill-cutoff\">跨境节日日历与履约截单</a> 共用同一份日历数据，区别在于那里用它做履约排产，这里用它做可预约性判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预约承诺的边界与变更\">预约承诺的边界与变更</h2><h3 id=\"承诺与期望的区分\">承诺与期望的区分</h3><p>如前述 FTC 规则所示，一旦对外表述为确定的发货日期，就产生告知延迟与退款的义务（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/435.2\">16 CFR § 435.2</a>）。这给出一条设计原则：<strong>对可承诺的时段给出承诺，对不可承诺的给出期望</strong>，并且两者在数据上分离。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>可承诺时段</th>\n<th>期望时段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据字段</td>\n<td><code>is_delivery_date_guaranteed = true</code></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>违约后果</td>\n<td>触发告知与退款流程</td>\n<td>触发致歉与补偿评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用条件</td>\n<td>本地、产能已确认、截单未过</td>\n<td>跨境、旺季、产能紧张</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 文案</td>\n<td>&quot;12 月 24 日送达&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;预计 12 月 24 日左右送达&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"变更与降级的处理\">变更与降级的处理</h3><p>改约与降级是必须预设的路径，而不是异常。四种场景各有确定处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>顾客主动改约</strong>：检查新时段是否有容量，有则直接换并释放旧容量；无则提供相邻时段。</li>\n<li><strong>承运商产能下降</strong>：批量降级，先降&quot;期望&quot;类订单，再降&quot;承诺&quot;类并按顺序给补偿。</li>\n<li><strong>路由不可行</strong>：在排线阶段发现某预约时段无法排入，应尽早触发改约（越早成本越低），并向付款人而非收件人发起——因为预约是付款人下的单。这条与惊喜保密的交互需要小心，见 <a href=\"gift-surprise-privacy-control\">惊喜保密与收件人隐私</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>顾客拒收</strong>：进入退货流程，见 <a href=\"../gift-return-risk/gift-return-refund-recipient-payer\">礼物退货退款：退付款人还是收件人</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>改约的时间经济学很明确：<strong>每延后一次决策，可选时段就越少、补偿越高</strong>。因此系统应在排线预演阶段就暴露不可行项，而不是等到发货当天才发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预约送达是<strong>先承诺、后执行</strong>的收益管理问题；学术上把配送时段定价建模为动态规划，近似动态规划方法在利润与稳健性上表现更优（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2008.00780\">arXiv:2008.00780</a>）。</li>\n<li>时段形态有从&quot;仅日期&quot;到&quot;精确时刻&quot;的连续谱，选择依据是<strong>精确度是否与承诺一致</strong>，而非越精确越好。</li>\n<li>时段产能按区域分别计算，且必须预留 <code>capacity_safety</code>；<strong>永不出售满额产能</strong>，否则第一次改约就无位可换。</li>\n<li>容量占用应分**软占用（hold）与硬占用（支付成功）**两阶段，避免并发超卖。</li>\n<li>截单时间是多条前置期约束中<strong>最紧的一条</strong>（取 min 而非求和），跨境场景由清关前置期主导；存储时绑定仓库时区。</li>\n<li>节日前的产能是断崖式下降，靠<strong>提前封锁不可预约日期</strong>而非精确计算来应对。</li>\n<li><strong>承诺与期望必须在数据上分离</strong>，因为一旦表述为确定发货日期就触发 FTC 规则下的告知与退款义务（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/435.2\">16 CFR § 435.2</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预约送达日期、时段与截单","id":"预约送达日期-时段与截单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时段的产品形态与产能模型","id":"时段的产品形态与产能模型"},{"level":3,"text":"五种常见的时段形态","id":"五种常见的时段形态"},{"level":3,"text":"产能模型：时段是一种有限资源","id":"产能模型-时段是一种有限资源"},{"level":3,"text":"容量扣减必须与支付状态联动","id":"容量扣减必须与支付状态联动"},{"level":2,"text":"截单时间：从承诺倒推","id":"截单时间-从承诺倒推"},{"level":3,"text":"截单不是时间点，是一条依赖链","id":"截单不是时间点-是一条依赖链"},{"level":3,"text":"截单时间的时区归属","id":"截单时间的时区归属"},{"level":3,"text":"节日前的非线性压缩","id":"节日前的非线性压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"预约承诺的边界与变更","id":"预约承诺的边界与变更"},{"level":3,"text":"承诺与期望的区分","id":"承诺与期望的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"变更与降级的处理","id":"变更与降级的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代付与多人凑单付款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-order-payforward-delivery/gift-payment-scheduled/pay-on-behalf-group-funding"},"next":{"title":"惊喜保密与收件人隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-order-payforward-delivery/gift-payment-scheduled/gift-surprise-privacy-control"}}